Elevated boot: the compiler of a verified-boot trust chain.

elebake builds, signs, attests and deploys a FreeBSD loader that measures the platform it boots on -- firmware tables, EFI variables, loaded images, TPM counters and PCRs, the boot medium, the disk -- and compares them with what the owner declared. Every command is a generator: it emits the shell it would run; the operator decides what executes.

WWW: https://github.com/enk-ode/elvboot
